Create video outline: "{{ title }}"
Target: {{ target_segments }} segments, ~{{ duration }}s each, total ~{{ target_segments * duration }}s

<content>
{{ content }}
</content>

<images>
{% if has_images %}
{{ images_text }}
{% else %}
No images available.
{% endif %}
</images>

<visuals>
Images (required, ≥1 per segment):
- document: when doc image directly relates to segment
- stock: real-world visuals (2-3 keywords)
- ai_generated: complex/abstract concepts (descriptive prompt)

Clips (optional, 0-1 per segment, all 5s):
- stock: real-world footage (2-3 keywords)
- ai_generated: only when motion essential (extremely rare)

Fields: source, query (null for document), path (filepath for document, null otherwise), timing (start|middle|end|throughout)
</visuals>

<narrative>
Arc: Hook → Development → Resolution
Per segment: narrative_hook (specific), transition_from_previous (explicit connection), transition_to_next (anticipation), content (detailed).
Use: question-answer bridges, problem-solution flows, cause-effect chains, contrast patterns.
</narrative>

<music>
Optional. Include only when enhancing experience. Provide descriptive prompt for mood/tempo/style, or null.
</music>

<requirements>
1. Engaging intro hook
2. Logical progression building complexity
3. Summary/conclusion segment
4. Smooth transitions between segments
5. 5 visual keywords per segment
6. One main idea per segment
7. Detailed content for voiceover
8. Cost-effective visual selection
9. JSON only, no markdown
</requirements>
